The files under references/ contain prose extracted from the LaTeX sources
of the manuscripts in that repository. The following modifications were made:

  * LaTeX markup was removed and mathematical notation was reduced to
    inline math, [EQ] for display equations, [CITE] for citations and
    [REF] for cross-references.
  * Figures, tables, bibliographies and acknowledgements were removed.
  * Prose was selected, merged and condensed per manuscript, and passages
    cut from within a fragment are marked with [...].
  * Fragments were grouped by writing module (abstract, introduction,
    preliminaries, statements, proof, conclusion) and by discipline.

papers.tsv records the source manuscript of every fragment; the @src label
at the head of each fragment gives its upstream directory.

The original manuscripts and their Lean formalizations are available at
https://github.com/openai/math under the Apache License, Version 2.0.